### ===== SETUP =====
POST http://localhost:5001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner1@wagba.test", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

> {% client.global.set("owner1", response.body.accessToken); %}

###
POST http://localhost:5001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner2@wagba.test", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

> {% client.global.set("owner2", response.body.accessToken); %}

###
POST http://localhost:5001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "customer1@wagba.test", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

> {% client.global.set("customer", response.body.accessToken); %}

###
POST http://localhost:5001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@wagba.com", "password": "ADMIN_PASSWORD_HERE" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Burger Town belongs to owner1 (it will be approved)
POST http://localhost:5002/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{owner1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Burger Town", "description": "Smash burgers and fries", "phone": "+201005550001", "address": "5 Nile Street, Cairo" }

> {% client.global.set("bid", response.body.id); %}

### Sushi Corner belongs to owner2 (it stays Pending)
POST http://localhost:5002/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{owner2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sushi Corner", "description": "Fresh sushi", "phone": "+201005550002", "address": "9 Garden City, Cairo" }

> {% client.global.set("sid", response.body.id); %}


### ===== BEFORE APPROVAL =====
### 1) Anonymous list: neither restaurant is there yet (both are Pending)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=burger

### 2) Pending restaurant, anonymous (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}


# >>> Now run section A of docs/kan20-test-data.sql (approves Burger Town) <<<


### ===== LIST =====
### 3) Burger Town appears. No ownerUserId and no reviewNote in the response
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=burger

### 4) The search ignores letter case (expect the same result)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=BURGER

### 5) It also searches the description
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=smash

### 6) Nothing matches (expect an empty content list, totalElements 0)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=zzzzzz

### 7) A percent sign is a normal character, not a wildcard (expect an empty list)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=%25

### 8) The unapproved restaurant never shows up (expect an empty list)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?search=sushi

### 9) Pagination
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?size=1&page=0

### 10) A page beyond the end (expect an empty content list, totals still correct)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?size=1&page=50

### 11) Size is capped (expect "size": 50) and a negative page becomes 0
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants?size=1000&page=-3


### ===== DETAILS AND VISIBILITY =====
### 12) Approved, anonymous (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}

### 13) Approved, with a customer token (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer}}

### 14) Pending, anonymous (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{sid}}

### 15) Pending, a customer (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{sid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer}}

### 16) Pending, another owner (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{sid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{owner1}}

### 17) Pending, its own owner (expect 200, status Pending)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{sid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{owner2}}

### 18) Pending, SuperAdmin (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{sid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 19) Unknown id (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 20) Not a UUID (expect 400, not 500)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/abc

### 21) A broken token on a public endpoint is rejected (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token


### ===== OPEN NOW AND ORDERABLE =====
### 22) No working hours set: openNow false, orderable false
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}

### 23) Open all day, every day (00:00 to 00:00 means 24 hours)
PUT http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{owner1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hours": [
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 2, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 3, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 4, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 5, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 6, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 7, "opensAt": "00:00", "closesAt": "00:00" }
  ]
}

### 24) Now openNow true and orderable true
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}

### 25) The owner stops accepting orders
PUT http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{owner1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "acceptingOrders": false }

### 26) openNow true but orderable false
GET http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}

### 27) Back to normal
PUT http://localhost:5002/restaurants/{{bid}}/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{owner1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "acceptingOrders": true }


